      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "**DEPRECATED in SPDX 3.1.**\nUse [/Core/Relationship](../../Core/Classes/Relationship.md)\nwith \"conformsTo\" relationship type instead.\n\nA standard with which the artifact complies."
